%% AEGIS MVP — technical / deployment architecture (as built in this repository)
flowchart LR
  classDef fe fill:#E8F1F8,stroke:#0B2545,color:#0B2545
  classDef svc fill:#0B2545,stroke:#0B2545,color:#fff
  classDef lib fill:#13636B,stroke:#13636B,color:#fff
  classDef store fill:#FFF7E6,stroke:#B7791F,color:#5F370E
  classDef ext fill:#F4F6F8,stroke:#8895A7,color:#333,stroke-dasharray: 4 3

  B[Browser<br/>static HTML/CSS + vanilla JS<br/>assessment-engine.js · analytics.js<br/>no cookies · no CDNs]:::fe
  CDN[CDN / static host<br/>app/website/dist]:::ext
  RP[Reverse proxy<br/>TLS · WAF]:::ext

  subgraph API[aegis_api — stdlib ThreadingHTTPServer]
    R[Router · validation · rate limit<br/>CSP & security headers]:::svc
    LEAD[Lead capture<br/>business-email gate · HMAC report tokens]:::svc
    EVT[Cookieless analytics]:::svc
  end

  subgraph CORE[Domain packages · app/*]
    AE[aegis_assessment<br/>maturity engine · risk tiering]:::lib
    RPT[aegis_reports<br/>Markdown · PDF · CSV · JSON]:::lib
    AGT[aegis_agent<br/>orchestrator · 14 tools · retrieval]:::lib
    SH[aegis_shield<br/>advisor · policy generator]:::lib
    PE[aegis_policy<br/>schema · evaluator · rollout modes]:::lib
    CMN[aegis_common<br/>content · audit chain · redaction · evidence labels]:::lib
  end

  subgraph CONTENT[Governed content · content/]
    CT[controls.yaml]:::store
    TPL[assessment templates]:::store
    PP[policy packs]:::store
    IP[industry packs]:::store
    EM[email templates<br/>approved / draft]:::store
  end

  subgraph VAR[Runtime data · var/]
    AUD[(audit logs<br/>hash-chained JSONL)]:::store
    LDS[(leads · reports · forms)]:::store
    APR[(approvals queue)]:::store
    AGS[(agent records<br/>inventory · assessments · tasks)]:::store
  end

  ADM[aegis_admin CLI<br/>audit verify · approvals · leads · funnel]:::svc
  CRM[CRM adapter<br/>JSONL · webhook · HubSpot]:::ext
  MAIL[Mail adapter<br/>outbox · SMTP]:::ext
  LLM[Optional LLM adapter<br/>redacted input · output validated]:::ext
  WORM[SIEM / WORM storage<br/>production]:::ext

  B -->|HTML| CDN
  B -->|/api JSON| RP --> R
  R --> LEAD & EVT
  R --> AE & AGT & SH
  LEAD --> AE --> RPT
  AGT --> AE & RPT & SH & PE
  SH --> PE
  AE & AGT & SH & PE --> CMN
  CMN --> CT & TPL
  SH --> PP
  AGT --> IP
  LEAD --> EM
  LEAD --> CRM & MAIL
  AGT -.optional.-> LLM
  R & AGT & PE --> AUD
  LEAD --> LDS
  AGT --> AGS & APR
  ADM --> AUD & APR & LDS
  AUD -.ship.-> WORM
